---
description: Skip UI screenshots when capture or attach is not possible; do not block the PR
alwaysApply: true
---

# Skip screenshots when capture fails

If screenshots cannot be taken (no working browser, port conflict, flaky local serve, attach failure), **skip them**.

- Do not open a draft/blocked PR solely because shots are missing.
- Note that shots were skipped; ship when machine gates pass.
- Still take and attach desktop + mobile shots when capture actually works.
